# S/MIME signature test vectors: signatures cover exact on-wire bytes (incl. CRLF),
# so git must NOT normalize line endings for these fixtures.
UnitTests/TestData/smime/thunderbird-signed.txt -text
UnitTests/TestData/smime/thunderbird-signed-encrypted.txt -text

# The root README describes the TypeScript port (it is ts/README.md, copied out by
# `pnpm sync:readme`), not upstream's C# library. Keep ours on `git merge upstream/master`
# instead of conflicting every time upstream touches its own README.
# Requires the driver to be defined once per clone:  git config merge.ours.driver true
/README.md merge=ours
